1
00:00:00,962 --> 00:00:03,632
(Howard:)For this, I went to MIT.

2
00:00:04,215 --> 00:00:05,295
(Sheldon:)And begin.

3
00:00:07,593 --> 00:00:09,803
[GRUNTING & GAGGING]

4
00:00:10,596 --> 00:00:13,346
(Raj:)I think I swallowed some paint.

5
00:00:13,516 --> 00:00:17,146
(Leonard:)I can't press any of the buttons
with my gloves.

6
00:00:17,478 --> 00:00:20,478
(Leonard:)Oh, son of a bitch.

7
00:00:20,648 --> 00:00:23,278
(Sheldon:)Adversity is to be expected. Continue.

8
00:00:23,443 --> 00:00:24,483
[BUZZ]

9
00:00:24,652 --> 00:00:26,782
(Howard:)Oh, boy, am I gonna get sued.

10
00:00:27,488 --> 00:00:29,318
- Okay, I can't do this.
- Me either.

11
00:00:29,490 --> 00:00:32,330
(Sheldon:)Gentlemen, use your imagination.
Innovate.

12
00:00:32,493 --> 00:00:37,333
(Sheldon:)Did Han Solo let Luke Skywalker freeze
to death on the ice planet of Hoth?

13
00:00:37,498 --> 00:00:42,838
(Sheldon:)No, he cut open a tauntaun and used
its internal body heat to warm him up.

14
00:00:43,296 --> 00:00:45,966
(Howard:)You heard the man.
Hold him down and I'll cut him open.

15
00:00:46,132 --> 00:00:50,052
(Leonard:)Hang on. I know I don't possess the tools
of leadership, but I don't understand...

16
00:00:50,261 --> 00:00:54,641
(Leonard:)...why we can't assemble the equipment
inside the hut and then take it outside.

17
00:00:55,892 --> 00:01:00,022
(Sheldon:)I hadn't thought of that.

